            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_244_133_947_543.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"59%\" />\n\nStage 1: Gradient Stocking\n\nPool Prompt + Answer\nQuery Prompt + Answer\nStage 2: Distilling Influence Rankings\nPool Prompt + Answer\nQuery Prompt + Answer\nStage 3: Influence Labels\n\nDecoder Model\n\nCountSketch Projections\n\nGround Truth Influence labels\n\n $ q_{1..n} \\in Q $\n\n $ p_{1..m} \\in P $\n\nAnswer\n\nLoRA\n\nBackprop Prompt Masked\n\nPrompt Masked\n\n $ q_{1..n} \\in Q $\n\n $ p_{1..m} \\in P $\n\nAnswer\n\nDecoder Model\n\nPrompt Masked\n\n $ q_{1..n} \\in Q $\n\nAnswer\n\nInfluence Embeddings\n\n $ p_{1..m} \\in P $\n\nAnswer\n\nEncoder Model\n\nEncoding\n\nModel\n\n(Influcoder)\n\nQuery Prompt + Answer\n\n $ q_{1..n} \\in Q $\n\nAnswer\n\n $ p_{1..m} \\in P $\n\nAnswer\n\nInfluence Embeddings\n\n $ p_{1..m} \\in Q $\n\nAnswer\n\nInfluence Labels\n\n</div>\n",
