        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "footprint. LoRIF (Li et al., 2026) further improves on storage and query time by leveraging the rank-c factors of projected gradients. Methods such as LESS (Xia et al., 2024) leverage LoRA (Hu et al., 2022) to calculate influence from gradients on the much smaller adapters. DataInf (Kwon et al., 2024) and RRInf (Tu et al., 2025) provide efficient estimations for the inverse hessian for LoRA based influence.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                701,
                584,
                946
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
